      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Reference Information\n\n- 1 cubic yard (cy) = 27 cubic feet\n- 1 foot (ft) = 12 inches (in)\n- 1 cy per linear foot (y³/ft) = 2.5 m³/m\n\n## Formula\n\n**v = 0.0031 × l × w × t**\n\nWhere:\n- v = required concrete (cubic yards)\n- l = length of footing (feet)\n- w = width of footing (feet)\n- t = depth of footing (inches)"
